 Filtre \u00e0 Tambour, Atomiseur, etc)<\/li>\n<li>Halle d\u2019essais de 3 pilotes OVH (Traitement des mati\u00e8res organiques en eau subcritique)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><u>Environnement<\/u>\u00a0: Aide \u00e0 la d\u00e9cision, Analyse de Cycle de Vie\/Co\u00fbt, Ecoconception, traitement d\u2019eau (analyses\/\u00e9tudes, r\u00e9alisation d\u2019unit\u00e9s de traitement)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul>\n<li>Secteurs d\u2019activit\u00e9s\u00a0: Nucl\u00e9aire, Hydrog\u00e8ne, Chimie, P\u00e9trochimie, Agro, Industrie Manufacturi\u00e8re, Energie, D\u00e9fense, etc.<\/li>\n<li>Moyens\u00a0: Atelier d\u2019assemblage 400m2+500m2 en construction (2 Ponts 5T), Laboratoire 300m2<\/li>\n<li>Certifications\u00a0: CEFRI E, ISO 9001, ISO 19443<\/li>\n<li>Membre GIFEN &amp; NUCLEAR VALLEY<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Cr\u00e9\u00e9e en 2004, INOVERTIS est sp\u00e9cialis\u00e9e dans l\u2019ing\u00e9nierie et la fabrication d\u2019\u00e9quipements ou unit\u00e9s industrielles cl\u00e9s-en-main. Nos activit\u00e9s : Ensemblier\/Cl\u00e9-en-Main \u00e0 fa\u00e7on\u00a0: Conception\/Fabrication\/Montage\/Mise en service\/Maintenance de Machines Sp\u00e9ciales au sein de nos ateliers\u00a0: Process\u00a0: SKID (\u00e9chelle labo\/pilote\/industrielle) M\u00e9catronique\u00a0: Unit\u00e9s d\u2019assemblage, manutention, conditionnement, outillages de production, etc &nbsp; Ing\u00e9nierie industrielle\/BE\/MOE\u00a0: Conception, Calcul, Dimensionnement<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":61,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[47],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-5661","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","categor